{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29173","headline":"泛溪夜回寄道玄上人 · 许浑","name":"泛溪夜回寄道玄上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南郭烟光异世间，碧桃红杏水潺潺。\n猨来近岭猕猴散，鱼下深潭翡翠闲。\n犹阻晚风停桂檝，欲乘春月访松关。\n几回策杖终难去，洞口云归不见山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}